  "description": "The FRS is ready to tackle anything thanks to its ROCKSHOX suspension duo, a reliable choice for freeride.\n• The fork is a ROCKSHOX BoXXer Ultimate equipped with the Charger 3 hydraulic cartridge for simple and precise adjustments. The shock is a ROCKSHOX Vivid Coil Ultimate DH that provides increased sensitivity and optimal control on the most demanding terrain.\n• Progressive and consistent, the TRP DH-R EVO PRO handles braking on this build.\n• The DT SWISS F1900 Classic wheels are hand-assembled. They are durable and allow you to chain together runs.\n• The drivetrain is handled by the SRAM GX DH group. The 7-speed shifts are precise and suited for downhill riding.",
